WEBVTT

01:33.100 --> 01:36.160
OUR GENERATION

01:36.200 --> 01:39.180
EPISODE 11

01:54.600 --> 01:55.460
Auntie Liang.

01:57.980 --> 01:59.720
The medical expenses for Jiang Qiaoxi.

02:11.220 --> 02:12.860
Anything else you want to tell me?

02:13.900 --> 02:14.920
Auntie Liang.

02:16.720 --> 02:18.620
Jiang Qiaoxi and I are classmates

02:19.520 --> 02:20.780
and I want to be friends with him.

02:23.860 --> 02:25.140
Be friends?

02:28.180 --> 02:30.960
Don't you have anything
more important in your life?

02:31.800 --> 02:33.500
Is making friends

02:34.080 --> 02:35.240
your focus for life?

02:36.480 --> 02:39.740
My daily life is my focus.

02:40.880 --> 02:44.480
Friends, family, studies,
they're all core chapters of my life.

02:44.520 --> 02:47.600
But Jiang Qiaoxi's focus
is on the Olympiad math.

02:48.140 --> 02:49.760
He's chosen by mathematics,

02:49.800 --> 02:52.100
destined for the
international competition stage.

02:53.740 --> 02:54.780
Will it affect

02:55.280 --> 02:56.260
my friendship with him?

03:01.800 --> 03:03.920
It'll ruin our mother-son bond.

03:07.880 --> 03:09.280
Back when you were little,

03:09.960 --> 03:11.740
you tricked me to your backyard

03:13.200 --> 03:15.500
and asked me to "Love Jiang Qiaoxi more".

03:16.600 --> 03:18.200
Then can you promise me this?

03:19.480 --> 03:21.800
If Jiang Qiaoxi goes back
to the provincial city with you,

03:22.360 --> 03:23.420
will you love him more?

03:24.000 --> 03:25.660
He doesn't really like black.

03:25.700 --> 03:27.660
His favorite color is red.

03:28.160 --> 03:29.860
His favorite animal is rabbits.

03:30.400 --> 03:32.060
And his favorite food is jujube buns.

03:32.600 --> 03:35.400
If you make them for him,
remember to add a little milk.

03:35.440 --> 03:37.560
It'll make them softer and tastier.

03:38.540 --> 03:41.260
I found it utterly absurd

03:41.800 --> 03:42.760
coming from a child.

03:44.860 --> 03:46.740
When I gave birth to Jiang Qiaoxi,

03:47.240 --> 03:48.220
I hemorrhaged badly,

03:48.720 --> 03:50.360
36 blood bags transfused.

03:50.940 --> 03:53.540
This child was born
through every last drop of my blood.

03:56.960 --> 03:58.480
No one could possibly
love him more than I do.

04:00.380 --> 04:01.540
Like his brother before him,

04:02.040 --> 04:04.060
Qiaoxi showed extraordinary
mathematical talent

04:04.100 --> 04:06.280
from little.

04:06.320 --> 04:07.600
My duty became clear.

04:07.640 --> 04:10.000
To clear his path
to the International Olympiad stage,

04:10.040 --> 04:12.280
to remove every obstacle

04:14.140 --> 04:16.459
and ensure he reaches that finish line.

04:18.300 --> 04:19.640
But you…

04:22.740 --> 04:24.820
are the one who's steering him off course.

04:28.160 --> 04:31.500
I have never affected
his academic performance.

04:31.540 --> 04:33.440
For you,

04:33.480 --> 04:36.640
he keeps defying me at all costs.

04:38.180 --> 04:41.100
Yingtao, if you truly care about him,

04:41.780 --> 04:43.200
if you want what's best for him,

04:44.000 --> 04:45.900
please stay away from him, okay?

04:48.100 --> 04:49.380
Otherwise, because of you,

04:51.360 --> 04:54.240
he might never reach
the stage he's destined for.

04:57.800 --> 04:59.100
More importantly,

05:01.940 --> 05:03.860
you'll ruin our relationship.

05:04.400 --> 05:05.400
When that happens,

05:06.180 --> 05:07.880
I'll lose my son

05:09.020 --> 05:10.420
and Jiang Qiaoxi…

05:11.440 --> 05:13.500
will lose his mother.

05:18.720 --> 05:19.560
I…

05:21.640 --> 05:23.060
I won't…

05:25.800 --> 05:26.760
I won't…

05:26.800 --> 05:27.640
Exactly!

05:28.500 --> 05:29.380
Yingtao.

05:30.700 --> 05:31.580
You wouldn't.

05:31.620 --> 05:33.640
You've always been a sensible child.

05:34.520 --> 05:35.780
Even as a little girl,

05:35.820 --> 05:37.940
you made the right choice.

05:39.240 --> 05:42.360
Now, you know better than anyone
what needs to be done,

05:43.000 --> 05:43.840
don't you?

06:15.040 --> 06:16.280
More importantly,

06:16.780 --> 06:18.740
you'll ruin our relationship.

06:20.040 --> 06:21.080
When that happens,

06:21.880 --> 06:23.560
I'll lose my son

06:24.420 --> 06:25.700
and Jiang Qiaoxi…

06:26.200 --> 06:27.900
will lose his mother.

06:37.960 --> 06:38.800
Hello.

06:38.840 --> 06:40.200
Hello, Yingtao.

06:40.240 --> 06:41.320
Jiang Qiaoxi?

06:42.440 --> 06:44.000
You…

06:44.560 --> 06:45.880
You're allowed to phone me?

06:46.380 --> 06:47.700
They are not at home.

06:49.380 --> 06:51.620
How is your wound? Does it hurt?

06:53.960 --> 06:54.860
Yingtao.

06:55.620 --> 06:57.460
I've been recovering at home these days,

06:57.500 --> 06:59.100
so I don't need to
attend the training camp.

06:59.140 --> 07:00.240
After school tomorrow…

07:00.280 --> 07:03.040
could you…bring me some
jujube buns and stuffed lotus roots?

07:03.080 --> 07:03.920
I…

07:06.160 --> 07:07.000
I…

07:10.000 --> 07:12.560
I'll see… how it goes tomorrow.

07:12.600 --> 07:15.840
You should rest early,
get some sleep and recover well.

07:15.880 --> 07:17.060
I'm heading to bed too.

07:17.100 --> 07:17.940
Goodnight.

07:39.160 --> 07:41.420
- Go for it, Yu Qiao!
- Yu Qiao!

07:41.460 --> 07:43.660
- Go for it, Yu Qiao!
- Yu Qiao!

07:43.700 --> 07:45.520
- Go for it, Yu Qiao!
- Go for it, Yu Qiao!

07:46.060 --> 07:47.500
- Yu Qiao!
- Yu Qiao!

07:47.540 --> 07:48.500
Go!

07:48.540 --> 07:49.820
- Go for it, Yu Qiao!
- Come on!

07:49.860 --> 07:50.760
- Yu Qiao!
- Go for it!

07:50.800 --> 07:52.120
- Go for it, Yu Qiao!
- Keep it up!

07:52.160 --> 07:53.080
Go for it, Yu Qiao!

07:53.120 --> 07:54.140
- Yu Qiao!
- Yu Qiao!

07:54.180 --> 07:55.300
- Yu Qiao!
- Yu Qiao!

07:55.340 --> 07:56.240
- Yu Qiao!
- Yeah!

07:58.980 --> 08:00.480
Yingtao, what's wrong? Yu Qiao won!

08:02.100 --> 08:04.440
Nothing. I'm happy too.

08:05.760 --> 08:06.820
Lin Yingtao, what's going on?

08:06.860 --> 08:07.740
You're acting strange.

08:08.940 --> 08:09.780
No, I'm not!

08:17.100 --> 08:18.420
Hello, Aunt Shuangyan.

08:20.760 --> 08:21.980
Well done!

08:22.020 --> 08:23.000
Nice!

08:26.160 --> 08:27.300
What's the matter?

08:27.340 --> 08:28.340
Qin Yeyun!

08:29.540 --> 08:30.720
Congratulations, Yu Qiao.

08:30.760 --> 08:32.120
Gotta run, stuff to do at home.

08:32.880 --> 08:34.340
I'll go with her.

08:34.960 --> 08:36.740
Why does Qin Yeyun look so pale?

08:37.360 --> 08:38.419
Is Uncle Qin Okay?

08:39.159 --> 08:40.000
Probably.

08:40.500 --> 08:41.840
Aunt Shuangyan just called.

08:41.880 --> 08:43.520
Then let's hurry over there.

08:43.559 --> 08:45.600
Don't worry, Yu Qiao. My mom's there.

08:46.100 --> 08:47.380
Qin Yeyun probably won't be happy

08:47.420 --> 08:48.860
if we are all tagged along.

08:50.300 --> 08:51.400
You're right.

08:51.440 --> 08:53.860
Even though the school's
pretty lax during Sports Day,

08:54.360 --> 08:57.240
we should stay
and cover for Yingtao and Yeyun.

08:58.300 --> 08:59.400
Brother Qin,

08:59.440 --> 09:00.780
we agreed you'd just

09:01.280 --> 09:02.940
rest in bed at home.

09:03.440 --> 09:05.040
If you keep moving around like this,

09:05.080 --> 09:06.900
your leg will get worse, then what?

09:06.940 --> 09:07.840
I'm fine.

09:07.880 --> 09:08.720
It won't get worse.

09:09.660 --> 09:11.440
Don't listen to those doctors' nonsense.

09:11.980 --> 09:15.720
I know my own body best.

09:16.300 --> 09:17.560
This old leg problem?

09:18.060 --> 09:19.260
It is what it is.

09:19.900 --> 09:21.400
Wasting money on treatment

09:21.440 --> 09:22.660
won't help.

09:23.200 --> 09:25.740
My Yun's growing up fast.

09:26.240 --> 09:28.240
I can't afford to lose
even a single day's work.

09:29.080 --> 09:31.000
Every day, the expenses just pile up.

09:33.420 --> 09:34.260
Sit down quickly!

09:34.300 --> 09:35.720
Why are you back?

09:35.760 --> 09:37.140
You should be in school.

09:37.740 --> 09:39.140
Go back to school.

09:39.180 --> 09:40.500
- Go back to school.
- I can't stop you.

09:40.540 --> 09:42.140
I can only tell Yun.

09:42.180 --> 09:44.180
When she heard you were discharged,
she panicked

09:44.220 --> 09:45.100
and rushed straight home.

09:45.140 --> 09:46.300
Dad's well now.

09:47.260 --> 09:48.200
Go back to school.

09:49.000 --> 09:51.840
Go back to the hospital with me,
or I ask an ambulance to pick you up?

09:52.620 --> 09:53.860
This kid!

09:55.360 --> 09:57.580
Talking nonsense! An ambulance?

09:57.620 --> 10:00.660
That'd be wasting medical resources.

10:00.700 --> 10:01.960
Dad's really fine now.

10:02.000 --> 10:03.420
No pain at all. Look.

10:03.920 --> 10:04.760
Dad!

10:06.240 --> 10:08.340
Minor setback.

10:10.080 --> 10:10.920
Alright.

10:12.600 --> 10:13.440
I…

10:14.040 --> 10:15.600
Dad, I will drop out of school.

10:16.100 --> 10:17.440
What did you say?

10:18.860 --> 10:19.980
Say it again.

10:20.960 --> 10:22.380
- I'll look for a job tomorrow.
- What?

10:23.920 --> 10:26.540
- I can support myself.
- Yun, what are you doing?

10:27.660 --> 10:28.960
Yun, you…

10:29.000 --> 10:30.840
Yun, what are you doing?

10:30.880 --> 10:32.000
Stop!

10:32.040 --> 10:35.500
- You can't do this.
- I'm sick of it.

10:36.080 --> 10:37.900
Sick of watching you kill yourself for me.

10:37.940 --> 10:39.000
I don't need it.

10:40.900 --> 10:42.880
What are you doing?

10:44.100 --> 10:46.300
Don't read those pages.

10:47.200 --> 10:48.320
Leave it alone!

10:48.360 --> 10:50.240
Stop it, Yun.

10:50.280 --> 10:52.700
- Just stop!
- From now on, let it be mine.

10:53.320 --> 10:55.920
I promise you.
I'll achieve them all on my own.

10:56.580 --> 11:01.340
Qin Yeyun, you're still so young!

11:03.400 --> 11:05.180
I'm your father.

11:05.220 --> 11:08.360
Shouldn't I be doing these things for you?

11:08.400 --> 11:10.200
But I'm your daughter too.

11:10.240 --> 11:12.920
I don't need you to shoulder all this,

11:14.360 --> 11:15.820
not when your leg's this bad.

11:15.860 --> 11:19.020
It's my turn to step up for our family.

11:20.420 --> 11:21.460
Dad.

11:22.780 --> 11:24.920
I want you to rest and recover properly.

11:25.420 --> 11:27.660
You deserve some good life, too.

11:31.040 --> 11:33.020
So what if I'm a cripple?

11:35.480 --> 11:41.160
Every other kid gets it,
my daughter will too.

11:50.740 --> 11:52.700
I want you to be just like them.

11:53.980 --> 11:54.900
- Yingtao.
- I don't need…

11:54.940 --> 11:56.160
you to do all that for me.

11:56.200 --> 11:57.040
It's okay. Let's go.

11:57.080 --> 11:58.400
You are my dad, too!

11:58.440 --> 12:01.120
Let them say it all out and fight it out.

12:01.980 --> 12:03.740
Love needs to be heard.

12:07.880 --> 12:08.720
Let's go.

12:11.480 --> 12:12.320
Mom.

12:14.480 --> 12:16.120
Did you and Dad

12:16.640 --> 12:18.500
ever have expectations for me?

12:18.540 --> 12:20.900
For what kind of person I'd grow up to be?

12:22.340 --> 12:23.840
Lin Qile,

12:24.820 --> 12:26.040
'Qile' means joyful harmony.

12:26.540 --> 12:27.940
Just like your dad always hoped

12:27.980 --> 12:30.900
you'd be someone who stays truly happy.

12:31.960 --> 12:33.540
- Is that all?
- Yes.

12:35.780 --> 12:38.360
What if I fail to fulfill this mission?

12:39.380 --> 12:42.420
No one can be happy all their life.

12:42.460 --> 12:43.800
Do you think that if you're unhappy,

12:43.840 --> 12:45.340
we'll stop having you as daughter?

12:49.920 --> 12:51.000
But…

12:52.240 --> 12:54.580
the only remarkable thing I've ever done

12:54.620 --> 12:57.500
was getting into Class 18
of experimental high school.

12:57.540 --> 13:00.500
Beyond that, I'm really nothing special.

13:00.540 --> 13:02.500
You and Dad truly aren't disappointed?

13:04.860 --> 13:05.920
You know

13:05.960 --> 13:08.700
what my greatest achievement is?

13:10.380 --> 13:11.420
What…

13:16.360 --> 13:17.280
It is you.

13:17.780 --> 13:19.920
You chose me to be your mom.

13:26.140 --> 13:28.520
Thank you for being my mother.

13:30.820 --> 13:33.420
Okay, get off me. I'm cooking.

13:35.020 --> 13:36.120
I get it.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.560
What did you get?

13:38.200 --> 13:40.180
I really get it.

13:41.920 --> 13:42.920
I get it

13:43.420 --> 13:44.940
no matter who I become,

13:44.980 --> 13:46.800
I'll never lose you or Dad.

14:44.660 --> 14:45.820
Auntie Liang.

14:47.020 --> 14:48.100
Here are the stuffed lotus roots

14:48.140 --> 14:51.260
and jujube buns for Jiang Qiaoxi,
you and Uncle Jiang.

15:01.660 --> 15:03.180
Do you know what you are doing?

15:09.520 --> 15:10.660
If it is possible,

15:12.320 --> 15:14.800
even the slightest chance in this world

15:15.980 --> 15:18.380
for Jiang Qiaoxi to
lose his mother's love,

15:20.900 --> 15:23.140
then all the more reason
I must stand firmly by his side.

16:37.780 --> 16:40.520
HERO

18:00.880 --> 18:04.580
HERO

18:04.620 --> 18:06.520
Still giving Uncle Qin the cold shoulder?

18:07.020 --> 18:08.360
After that huge blowup,

18:08.400 --> 18:09.620
you two haven't made up yet?

18:10.700 --> 18:11.940
How do you know?

18:13.580 --> 18:14.940
I asked Du Shang.

18:15.660 --> 18:18.640
Du Shang asked Aunt Shuangyan.

18:23.440 --> 18:24.700
Why are you unhappy?

18:26.220 --> 18:27.680
Who says I'm unhappy?

18:31.660 --> 18:32.700
I'm…

18:32.740 --> 18:34.180
running 3,000 meters tomorrow,

18:35.500 --> 18:36.540
kinda freaking out about it.

18:37.780 --> 18:39.920
I know what makes you unhappy.

18:40.420 --> 18:41.640
For what?

18:42.660 --> 18:44.260
Because of…

18:44.300 --> 18:45.440
Jiang Qiaoxi.

18:54.880 --> 18:55.960
Why am I unhappy…

18:57.140 --> 18:59.600
because of Jiang Qiaoxi?

19:03.640 --> 19:04.740
Because of Ling Yingtao.

19:09.220 --> 19:10.900
I don't have any feelings for Lin Yingtao.

19:11.500 --> 19:12.680
Stop making things up.

19:14.340 --> 19:15.560
Feelings?

19:16.160 --> 19:18.320
I never said you liked her.

19:18.360 --> 19:19.860
Way to confess without being asked.

19:20.360 --> 19:21.700
Confess what?

19:32.320 --> 19:33.220
Qin Yeyun.

19:34.600 --> 19:36.220
How the hell did you even find out?

19:44.560 --> 19:45.400
Yu Qiao.

19:46.380 --> 19:48.620
If you want to
make this easier on yourself,

19:49.420 --> 19:51.120
try shifting your perspective.

19:52.720 --> 19:55.340
First, see Jiang Qiaoxi as your friend,

19:56.160 --> 19:57.980
then as the guy Yingtao likes.

20:11.180 --> 20:12.100
Qin Yeyun!

20:13.800 --> 20:15.020
Don't worry.

20:16.700 --> 20:18.020
I'll keep it a secret for you.

20:18.520 --> 20:19.480
No.

20:21.440 --> 20:22.700
I just want to ask you,

20:23.480 --> 20:24.700
if it were you,

20:25.200 --> 20:26.080
could you do it?

20:33.900 --> 20:35.000
I made it.

21:09.540 --> 21:11.520
Mom, would you like to have some?

21:13.180 --> 21:14.280
I will skip it.

21:26.080 --> 21:27.260
I won't stop you

21:27.760 --> 21:28.900
from making friends.

21:30.840 --> 21:32.620
But in ten years,

21:33.120 --> 21:34.620
twenty, maybe,

21:34.660 --> 21:36.820
you'll realize you've grown apart.

21:37.320 --> 21:40.140
Even their whereabouts become unknown.

21:40.180 --> 21:41.540
That's when you'll understand.

21:44.460 --> 21:45.300
Mom,

21:45.980 --> 21:47.940
Lin Yingtao and I, and the others,

21:48.980 --> 21:50.940
even in ten or twenty years,

21:51.440 --> 21:52.840
we'll still be friends.

21:58.200 --> 22:00.780
When I was your age,
I thought exactly the same.

22:00.820 --> 22:03.860
I believed my friendships
would last forever.

22:05.520 --> 22:06.900
But after graduation?

22:06.940 --> 22:09.400
We all quietly let go.

22:11.600 --> 22:12.880
Now…

22:16.700 --> 22:18.180
Now I only have you.

22:29.600 --> 22:30.520
Mom,

22:30.560 --> 22:31.800
those were

22:32.300 --> 22:34.180
just classmates.

22:35.660 --> 22:37.680
Real friends don't drift apart like that.

22:41.600 --> 22:43.620
You're getting wiser,

22:43.660 --> 22:45.700
more capable too.

22:46.780 --> 22:49.480
I don't care about classmates or friends.

22:49.980 --> 22:52.640
This winter camp,
you will make the national team.

22:53.180 --> 22:54.820
That's my only requirement.

22:56.220 --> 22:57.180
Can you do it?

23:02.620 --> 23:03.900
What if

23:06.340 --> 23:07.620
I can't make it?

23:22.680 --> 23:23.900
Drop that throught.

24:03.700 --> 24:04.700
Mom.

24:07.200 --> 24:08.860
I'll give you…

24:09.900 --> 24:10.880
what you want.

24:11.980 --> 24:13.660
That national team spot for the Olympiad,

24:14.420 --> 24:15.260
Consider it done.

25:16.060 --> 25:18.060
BUILDING POWER COMMUNITY TOGETHER,
CREATING A BRIGHTER FUTURE

25:18.780 --> 25:20.420
How many steps can you jump at once?

25:20.920 --> 25:21.880
That's easy.

25:21.920 --> 25:22.760
Easy?

25:22.800 --> 25:24.020
- I don't believe it.
- Where is Yu Qiao?

25:24.540 --> 25:25.500
- Morning, Yingtao.
- Hey, Yingtao.

25:25.540 --> 25:27.420
He left for school at dawn to warm up.

25:27.460 --> 25:28.560
Today's the 3,000-meter race.

25:29.060 --> 25:30.160
He's like Forrest Gump,

25:30.660 --> 25:32.400
training every single day.

25:32.440 --> 25:33.440
First place is his already.

25:34.600 --> 25:36.020
How is Qin Yeyun doing?

25:36.060 --> 25:37.180
You asked me?

25:37.220 --> 25:38.720
Didn't you three go to see her last night?

25:38.760 --> 25:39.660
Heartless.

25:40.160 --> 25:41.460
My goodness, Lin Yingtao.

25:41.500 --> 25:43.540
Don't go accusing us right off the bat.

25:43.580 --> 25:44.900
We actually went yesterday,

25:44.940 --> 25:46.840
got chewed out the second we showed up.

25:47.340 --> 25:49.540
She was firing indiscriminately!

25:50.800 --> 25:53.320
Well, at least letting her vent
counts as your contribution.

25:55.660 --> 25:57.320
Are you ready? Now,

25:57.360 --> 25:58.860
follow my tactical command.

25:58.900 --> 26:00.900
We're breaching her iron defenses.

26:02.880 --> 26:03.940
Move out!

26:06.480 --> 26:08.560
- Uncle Qin.
- Uncle Qin.

26:09.940 --> 26:10.980
Uncle Qin.

26:12.320 --> 26:14.320
Uncle Qin, got milk in stock today?

26:14.860 --> 26:16.020
Yes.

26:16.060 --> 26:18.200
Yun, get the milk.

26:18.840 --> 26:20.760
Uncle Qin, you got
any spicy strips in stock?

26:20.800 --> 26:21.940
Any of drumstick bread?

26:22.440 --> 26:23.440
Any pickled chicken feet?

26:25.040 --> 26:25.920
Of course.

26:26.420 --> 26:28.160
Come on, you know exactly
what I've got in here.

26:28.660 --> 26:29.700
Yun, get them.

26:29.740 --> 26:31.240
All of them.

26:33.140 --> 26:33.980
No need.

26:34.700 --> 26:36.340
We don't want any of these.

26:37.740 --> 26:38.680
What…

26:39.180 --> 26:41.580
- What does it mean?
- Mom made me promise.

26:41.620 --> 26:43.520
We can't buy anything here

26:43.560 --> 26:45.120
until Uncle Qin fully recovers.

26:45.760 --> 26:47.220
Same at our house.

26:47.260 --> 26:49.300
No trade, no hurt.

26:51.780 --> 26:53.360
What are you talking about?

26:53.400 --> 26:56.920
If you don't buy my goods,
that is real hurt.

26:57.420 --> 26:58.540
Sorry, Uncle Qin.

26:58.580 --> 27:00.440
We're just following orders.

27:03.800 --> 27:06.000
Auntie and Uncle are truly so thoughtful.

27:06.040 --> 27:08.760
Laugh all you want now, Qin Yeyun.

27:08.800 --> 27:10.580
Just wait till you regret skipping class!

27:11.080 --> 27:12.700
Haven't you heard the saying?

27:12.740 --> 27:14.600
"No child left in need.

27:14.640 --> 27:16.740
No school left behind."

27:16.780 --> 27:17.960
Exactly.

27:18.000 --> 27:19.780
"Play hard as it maybe

27:19.820 --> 27:22.020
but never take studies lightly."

27:23.980 --> 27:25.540
It's the final day of the Sports Day.

27:25.580 --> 27:27.020
You can stay home for today.

27:27.060 --> 27:28.400
But classes tomorrow?

27:28.440 --> 27:29.480
You'll be left behind!

27:30.060 --> 27:31.820
High school waits for no one.

27:31.860 --> 27:34.360
One class missed,
you're three chapters behind.

27:35.260 --> 27:37.060
Stop lecturing her.

27:37.100 --> 27:39.200
You think Qin Yeyun doesn't want to go?

27:39.700 --> 27:41.500
Of course she does!

27:42.060 --> 27:45.020
But Uncle Qin won't listen.

27:45.060 --> 27:46.960
Still, filial piety comes first.

27:47.460 --> 27:50.120
Just like Mulan
took her father's place in the army,

27:50.160 --> 27:52.140
now we have Yeyun
guards her father's shop.

27:52.640 --> 27:54.320
It's not like she has a choice.

27:54.360 --> 27:55.340
Right?

27:57.620 --> 28:02.120
Today's Yu Qiao's 3000m race,
you're really not going to cheer for him?

28:06.860 --> 28:08.240
I'm gonna go to school.

28:10.660 --> 28:12.280
- Goodbye, Uncle Qin.
- Goodbye, Uncle Qin.

28:12.320 --> 28:13.300
- Goodbye, Uncle Qin.
- Bye.

28:42.740 --> 28:44.500
Later when Jiang Qiaoxi comes back,

28:44.540 --> 28:46.000
will he go to school with us?

28:46.040 --> 28:47.620
How could we just let him

28:47.660 --> 28:48.980
waltz back to class with us?

28:49.640 --> 28:52.260
You might've forgiven him,
but I sure haven't.

28:52.300 --> 28:54.220
What do you mean, Cai Fangyuan?

28:54.760 --> 28:56.380
When he cut contact with you,

28:56.420 --> 28:58.100
he ghosted us too.

28:58.600 --> 29:01.400
Now he's making amends to you, fine.

29:01.900 --> 29:02.940
But to us?

29:02.980 --> 29:04.620
Where's our amends?

29:05.900 --> 29:07.240
What are you doing?

29:07.280 --> 29:09.980
I've already made up with him,
but you still can't?

29:10.020 --> 29:12.020
What, is Jiang Qiaoxi
your personal accessory?

29:12.740 --> 29:14.920
We're supposed to drop him when you do,

29:14.960 --> 29:16.800
and pick him back up
when you feel like it?

29:18.560 --> 29:19.420
You.

29:19.460 --> 29:20.400
Fair point.

29:21.460 --> 29:22.620
I'm with Cai Fangyuan this time.

29:22.660 --> 29:25.620
We did treat him
as a real friend all those years.

29:26.200 --> 29:28.800
These years without contact? It hurt.

29:29.340 --> 29:31.240
It froze me out.

29:31.280 --> 29:33.140
Let him figure out how to break the ice.

29:34.740 --> 29:36.120
What are you doing?

29:36.980 --> 29:39.260
Saturday night, at the beach.

29:39.300 --> 29:41.700
Let's see if he can move us.

30:01.800 --> 30:02.700
Brother Qin.

30:03.200 --> 30:04.880
This stubbornness of yours,

30:04.920 --> 30:07.940
you're hurting yourself
and holding Yeyun back.

30:08.780 --> 30:09.620
Right, of course.

30:10.320 --> 30:12.940
I've come around,

30:13.440 --> 30:14.340
no more stubbornness.

30:14.840 --> 30:17.580
Truth is, this damn leg's useless.

30:17.620 --> 30:20.040
Even the slightest move
brings unbearable pain.

30:20.700 --> 30:23.220
I… I was wrong.

30:23.260 --> 30:24.620
Now that you finally admit it,

30:24.660 --> 30:25.740
fix it.

30:26.440 --> 30:28.660
This was your mistake to begin with.

30:28.700 --> 30:31.640
Are you waiting for her apology first?

30:31.680 --> 30:32.680
Wouldn't dream of it!

30:33.180 --> 30:34.340
I'll change.

30:34.380 --> 30:35.320
Right now!

30:35.920 --> 30:38.520
I'm working on fixing things.

30:40.600 --> 30:41.860
Actually, here's an idea.

30:42.780 --> 30:43.720
Shuangyan,

30:43.760 --> 30:45.760
you're still running
that street stall, right?

30:45.800 --> 30:46.880
Listen,

30:46.920 --> 30:49.660
quit the roadside grind.

30:49.700 --> 30:51.980
Come work at my shop instead.

30:52.020 --> 30:53.040
I'll pay you monthly wages,

30:53.700 --> 30:56.400
more than the street stalls.

30:56.440 --> 30:59.220
No more baking in the sun
or freezing in the rain.

30:59.260 --> 31:01.160
Brother Qin, this won't work.

31:01.200 --> 31:03.260
Your shop's profits are slim as it is!

31:03.300 --> 31:04.960
Paying me a salary?
You'd barely break even.

31:06.400 --> 31:07.620
I am faking it.

31:07.660 --> 31:08.640
Fake?

31:09.920 --> 31:10.880
No but she works here too.

31:10.920 --> 31:12.020
Okay, fine.

31:12.520 --> 31:13.540
Tell you what,

31:14.040 --> 31:18.180
move your skewer stall
right next to my shop.

31:18.220 --> 31:21.280
You'll draw customers to me.

31:21.320 --> 31:23.400
You can sell your skewers as normal.

31:23.440 --> 31:25.860
I'll pay you for shop-minding.

31:25.900 --> 31:26.740
Everybody wins.

31:30.100 --> 31:30.940
Sure.

31:32.380 --> 31:34.260
- Sure.
- Done deal, Shuangyan!

31:34.300 --> 31:36.000
A handshake seals it, no take backs.

31:51.800 --> 31:52.960
Hi, Aunt Shuangyan.

31:53.000 --> 31:55.060
Where… are you going?

31:56.320 --> 31:57.360
Go to school.

32:12.240 --> 32:13.180
Qin Yeyun.

32:15.760 --> 32:17.000
Could you check

32:17.040 --> 32:19.440
if your family's store
carries plates with this pattern?

32:19.480 --> 32:20.180
BE SAFE

32:20.220 --> 32:21.280
We do have them,

32:21.820 --> 32:24.280
but right now, there's something
far more important than plates.

32:25.700 --> 32:28.180
- What do you mean?
- Yu Qiao's running the 3000-meter today.

32:28.220 --> 32:29.940
We're all going to cheer.

32:30.520 --> 32:31.460
You in?

32:41.720 --> 32:44.460
In this 3000-meter odyssey,

32:44.500 --> 32:47.100
you are the master warrior

32:47.140 --> 32:50.280
- embarking on an epic quest.
- Yu Qiao, go for it!

32:50.320 --> 32:53.180
- Every stride channels your inner energy,
- Come on!

32:53.220 --> 32:56.480
each breath condenses your vital essence.

32:56.520 --> 32:57.760
Feng Letian's broadcasting.

32:57.800 --> 33:00.780
He is truly a Wuxia novelist. Turning
the game into some chivalrous epic?

33:00.820 --> 33:01.940
Absolutely.

33:02.440 --> 33:04.480
- Come on!
- I see huge potential in

33:04.520 --> 33:05.860
- Feng's writings.
- Go for it, Yu Qiao!

33:05.900 --> 33:06.740
- I am…
- Come on!

33:06.780 --> 33:08.060
- CEO of the site,
- Yu Qiao!

33:08.100 --> 33:09.600
- and part-time CFO,
- Come on!

33:09.640 --> 33:11.560
I've decided to go back with him
and offer some notes.

33:11.600 --> 33:13.540
- Less of this endless leveling up.
- Come on!

33:13.580 --> 33:16.480
- Write some reunions between old friends.
- Keep it up!

33:16.520 --> 33:18.460
- Turning swords into plowshares.
- Stop it.

33:18.500 --> 33:19.920
We humans crave
emotional stakes, you know?

33:19.960 --> 33:21.360
Stop talking and cheer him on quickly!

33:21.400 --> 33:22.920
- Yu Qiao, go for it!
- Go for it!

33:22.960 --> 33:24.740
- Yu Qiao, keep it up!
- Yu Qiao, keep it up!

33:24.780 --> 33:26.440
- Yu Qiao, go for it!
- Yu Qiao!

33:26.480 --> 33:27.880
- Come on!
- Come on, Yu Qiao!

33:27.920 --> 33:29.700
- Come on!
- Go!

33:29.740 --> 33:30.580
Hi!

33:30.620 --> 33:31.500
Where is Yu Qiao?

33:31.540 --> 33:32.940
Why are you here?

33:32.980 --> 33:34.180
- Just here for the vibes!
- Yu Qiao!

33:34.220 --> 33:36.260
- Let me check the wound.
- Yu Qiao, go for it!

33:36.300 --> 33:37.520
- Are you okay?
- Come on!

33:37.560 --> 33:38.680
- Small wound.
- Yu Qiao, go for it!

33:38.720 --> 33:40.280
- Does it hurt?
- No.

33:41.900 --> 33:43.440
- Where's Yu Qiao?
- There!

33:43.480 --> 33:45.220
Jiang Qiaoxi at least
show some respect for me.

33:45.260 --> 33:46.920
Yu Qiao, go for it!

33:46.960 --> 33:49.760
- Yu Qiao!
- Yu Qiao, go for it!

33:50.300 --> 33:52.240
Yu Qiao, go for it!

33:52.280 --> 33:54.460
Yu Qiao, go for it!

33:54.960 --> 33:56.300
Go for it!

33:56.340 --> 33:58.920
Jiang Qiaoxi's here for you.

33:58.960 --> 34:00.920
- Yu Qiao, go for it!
- Go for it!

34:00.960 --> 34:02.520
- Yu Qiao, go for it!
- Go for it!

34:02.560 --> 34:03.520
Yu Qiao!

34:04.020 --> 34:05.500
- Yu Qiao, go!
- My voice is nearly gone.

34:05.540 --> 34:09.179
- You shout for me.
- Yu Qiao, go for it!

34:36.159 --> 34:37.380
What's wrong with Yu Qiao?

34:40.060 --> 34:40.960
What?

34:41.460 --> 34:42.679
- Yu Qiao!
- Let's go.

34:54.600 --> 34:55.620
Cai Fangyuan!

34:56.120 --> 34:57.160
Let's wait for him at the finish line.

34:57.660 --> 34:58.500
- Go.
- Okay.

34:59.620 --> 35:01.160
Go easy on Yu Qiao.

35:01.660 --> 35:03.860
Exactly. We have Jiang Qiaoxi over there.

35:26.720 --> 35:27.840
No need to rush.

35:28.720 --> 35:29.780
Just get it done right.

35:35.060 --> 35:36.840
Yu Qiao, go for it!

35:37.340 --> 35:38.280
- Yu Qiao.
- Come on, Yu Qiao.

35:38.320 --> 35:39.280
Yu Qiao, go for it!

35:43.700 --> 35:44.980
Just focus ahead,

35:46.780 --> 35:48.240
Be steady for every step.

35:49.320 --> 35:50.740
The finish line will come.

35:51.240 --> 35:52.780
Go for it, Jiang Qiaoxi!

35:53.640 --> 35:55.720
No need to rush. Just focus ahead,

35:56.220 --> 35:57.940
Be steady for every step.

35:57.980 --> 36:00.180
The finish line will come.

36:00.960 --> 36:02.120
That's exactly

36:02.660 --> 36:04.440
what I told you

36:05.060 --> 36:06.160
at the fourth-grade field day.

36:06.660 --> 36:07.720
That's right.

36:08.940 --> 36:10.400
Now it's my turn to say it to you.

36:10.440 --> 36:11.620
Go for it, Yu Qiao!

36:11.660 --> 36:12.760
Don't think by doing it,

36:12.800 --> 36:14.340
- Go for it, Yu Qiao!
- Keep up!

36:14.380 --> 36:16.280
I'll get you that half letter.

36:17.040 --> 36:17.880
No rush.

36:18.620 --> 36:19.960
- You can do it later.
- Come on!

36:20.000 --> 36:21.260
Yu Qiao!

36:21.760 --> 36:22.600
Hang on!

36:23.100 --> 36:24.580
Go for it!

36:25.520 --> 36:26.920
- Keep it up!
- Keep up!

36:26.960 --> 36:28.400
- Yu Qiao, Go for it!
- Go for it!

36:29.740 --> 36:30.680
Go for it!

36:31.180 --> 36:32.460
Take it slow.

36:32.960 --> 36:33.800
Hang on!

36:33.840 --> 36:35.100
- Hang on, Yu Qiao!
- Yu Qiao!

36:35.960 --> 36:36.800
Tenth to the line.

36:42.440 --> 36:43.680
- Are you okay?
- Are you okay?

36:43.720 --> 36:45.260
- Okay?
- Be careful.

36:45.300 --> 36:46.640
- Go to the infirmary.
- Go.

36:46.680 --> 36:47.540
Under this blue sky,

36:47.580 --> 36:48.480
- Their friendship shines.
- Be careful.

36:48.520 --> 36:50.640
- Take it easy.
- On this arduous journey,

36:50.680 --> 36:52.140
- they stood for each other,
- Careful.

36:52.180 --> 36:53.740
with deepest sincerity.

36:53.780 --> 36:57.180
In this very moment,
their friendship transcends into legend.

36:57.220 --> 36:58.680
- Thank you, Ms.
- Be careful.

36:59.820 --> 37:00.860
- Alright?
- Alright.

37:00.900 --> 37:02.140
Well? You're not lame, are you?

37:02.640 --> 37:04.260
- Slow down.
- Qin Yeyun.

37:04.760 --> 37:06.240
Could you find a nicer way to say that?

37:06.780 --> 37:08.200
So, are you alright?

37:08.740 --> 37:09.940
Alright.

37:09.980 --> 37:11.560
Just a sprained ankle.

37:11.600 --> 37:13.220
Some spray and rest,
good as new in two days.

37:15.200 --> 37:16.200
Where is Jiang Qiaoxi?

37:16.760 --> 37:17.940
He went back to study,

37:17.980 --> 37:19.680
got that winter camp coming up.

37:20.520 --> 37:23.120
But he only left
after making sure you were okay.

37:23.740 --> 37:25.480
He shouldn't have come today at all.

37:26.140 --> 37:27.900
With the Olympiad this close,

37:28.460 --> 37:29.520
and that head injury?

37:29.560 --> 37:32.180
He should stay home study
and take some more rest.

37:32.220 --> 37:33.520
Why is he here?

37:33.560 --> 37:34.620
To enjoy the show

37:34.660 --> 37:36.180
that you clinched last place.

37:37.500 --> 37:40.000
Running around with a busted head.

37:40.500 --> 37:41.720
He is not kids anymore.

37:42.220 --> 37:44.020
When will he learn to
take care of himself?

37:46.700 --> 37:48.380
Are you concerned about Jiang Qiaoxi?

37:49.560 --> 37:50.440
Don't be ridiculous.

37:50.480 --> 37:51.800
Impossible.

37:52.520 --> 37:54.140
Why on earth would I care about him?

38:00.380 --> 38:01.380
Jiang Qiaoxi.

38:05.320 --> 38:06.300
Jiang Qiaoxi.

38:08.120 --> 38:10.540
How is your wound?
Are you feeling better now?

38:11.040 --> 38:12.500
Didn't my mom tell you?

38:14.900 --> 38:16.340
I'm just very worried about you.

38:16.380 --> 38:17.620
We are friends.

38:19.520 --> 38:21.460
You don't even understand
the meaning of friendship.

38:23.440 --> 38:25.860
Real friends push each other forward.

38:25.900 --> 38:27.380
They make you better,

38:27.880 --> 38:29.080
never harm you,

38:29.120 --> 38:31.400
and certainly don't come
between your family.

38:32.200 --> 38:34.240
My friend didn't hurt me.

38:34.280 --> 38:36.380
I am happy that I can do that for her.

38:37.660 --> 38:38.640
And honestly,

38:39.320 --> 38:42.840
I'm doing much better now.

38:46.600 --> 38:48.740
Feel free to report
all this back to my mom.

38:49.880 --> 38:51.040
Jiang Qiaoxi.

38:51.540 --> 38:53.360
Stop being so stubborn and wake up!

39:02.420 --> 39:03.500
How is Yu Qiao's foot?

39:04.760 --> 39:07.800
He said it was just a mild sprain,
nothing serious.

39:11.740 --> 39:13.720
He used to top
in the long-distance race every year.

39:13.760 --> 39:15.380
But he came in last this year.

39:15.420 --> 39:16.860
I hope he's not too upset.

39:16.900 --> 39:19.660
How did you know
he won first place every year?

39:19.700 --> 39:21.100
Of course I know!

39:22.360 --> 39:23.760
I also know

39:23.800 --> 39:26.480
Yu Qiao dreams of
becoming an air force pilot.

39:26.520 --> 39:28.540
That's why he cares particularly
about his eyesight.

39:29.540 --> 39:30.760
As for Du Shang,

39:31.260 --> 39:32.900
he wants to study medicine,

39:33.420 --> 39:36.680
so he spends all his free time
reading medical books.

39:37.380 --> 39:38.700
And Cai Fangyuan,

39:38.740 --> 39:42.400
he's been working on his own
literature website since Year 10.

39:44.220 --> 39:46.420
So you've been secretly
keeping an eye on them all along.

39:46.460 --> 39:47.420
Of course.

39:50.140 --> 39:51.100
But

39:52.280 --> 39:55.380
all I can do is watch them from afar.

39:57.160 --> 39:59.000
You deserve real praise
for staying with Yu Qiao

39:59.040 --> 40:00.780
all the way to the finish line today.

40:00.820 --> 40:01.660
Tada!

40:02.380 --> 40:03.740
There's nothing to praise.

40:04.240 --> 40:05.340
This is just who I am.

40:06.100 --> 40:08.400
I just never got the chance
to show it before.

40:13.220 --> 40:14.940
Well you'll have to work hard for it.

40:15.640 --> 40:17.900
Cai Fangyuan and Du Shang's hearts

40:17.940 --> 40:19.520
are still ice-cold towards you.

40:20.020 --> 40:22.520
Whether they'll accept you back
in Qunshan Squard,

40:23.580 --> 40:24.720
it is still a question.

40:27.740 --> 40:28.600
Really?

40:29.100 --> 40:30.400
Really.

40:30.440 --> 40:31.820
I tried to persuade them but fail.

40:41.360 --> 40:43.240
Relax, Yingtao.

40:43.280 --> 40:45.500
I'll make sure they come around.

40:46.040 --> 40:47.120
And worst case,

40:47.160 --> 40:48.460
you've got my back, right?

40:48.500 --> 40:50.500
Ms. Lin, teach me, please.

40:50.540 --> 40:52.480
You're the expert at fixing things.

40:54.440 --> 40:55.800
Those two.

40:56.300 --> 40:58.120
They've invited you
to the beach this Saturday.

40:58.660 --> 41:01.240
Whether you can win them over
and melt their icy hearts,

41:01.280 --> 41:03.100
well, that's up to you now.

41:04.080 --> 41:05.220
You've only got one shot.

41:07.440 --> 41:09.900
The beach?

41:24.680 --> 41:25.520
Okay.

41:26.020 --> 41:28.540
I'll work hard.

41:28.580 --> 41:30.020
I'll prove myself.

41:35.020 --> 41:35.940
What's so funny?

41:38.540 --> 41:40.200
Oh come on, why so serious?

41:41.100 --> 41:43.340
- Come on.
- You're kidding me?

41:45.900 --> 41:47.620
Did you see your face just now?

41:48.560 --> 41:50.800
They were totally messing with me.

41:50.840 --> 41:51.960
But who do they think I am?

41:52.000 --> 41:53.140
I'm way too clever

41:53.180 --> 41:54.780
to fall for that.

41:56.120 --> 41:58.180
That beach invitation?
It's obviously their way

41:58.220 --> 42:01.740
to officially welcome you back
to the Qunshan Squard.

42:02.980 --> 42:04.300
So it's a welcome.

42:04.880 --> 42:07.240
And here I was,
all geared up to face their trials.

42:08.820 --> 42:10.620
I've made up my mind. This Saturday,

42:10.660 --> 42:12.960
we're going to the beach
to set off fireworks.

42:14.400 --> 42:17.100
We'll make up for the ones
we missed last time.

42:57.960 --> 42:58.800
My goodness.

42:58.840 --> 42:59.680
How beautiful!

42:59.720 --> 43:01.440
Look at this one. Looks like a butterfly.

43:01.480 --> 43:02.560
- Look!
- Wow.

43:09.540 --> 43:11.600
Lin Yingtao, what's wrong with you?

43:12.660 --> 43:14.080
Isn't it beautiful?

43:15.100 --> 43:16.080
It's good.

43:16.580 --> 43:17.640
Very beautiful.

43:19.120 --> 43:21.160
Why is it so beautiful?

43:22.140 --> 43:24.120
It's annoying.

43:25.380 --> 43:27.140
Why is it annoying?

43:28.460 --> 43:29.500
Because…

43:32.520 --> 43:34.220
Jiang Qiaoxi's not here.

43:34.260 --> 43:35.940
Don't cry, Ling Yingtao.

43:35.980 --> 43:37.360
No crying during New Year's.

43:42.940 --> 43:44.140
Seven years.

43:44.780 --> 43:46.140
Seven long years.

43:46.640 --> 43:48.060
They are all behind us now.

43:50.660 --> 43:51.520
Jiang Qiaoxi.

43:52.020 --> 43:55.380
We've got so many more
seven-year chapters ahead of us.

43:57.140 --> 43:57.980
True.

43:58.480 --> 43:59.460
For the future,

43:59.960 --> 44:02.060
we have many more
seven-year chapters to come.

46:27.680 --> 46:30.680
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
